[SIZE=5][COLOR=#00c6ff][B]✦ Why Choose BlueHellStats?[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

Most statistics plugins freeze your server, drop TPS, or cause lag spikes when saving player data.

[B]BlueHellStats[/B] is designed specifically for server owners who want an **ultra-optimized, plug-and-play solution** that runs smooth as butter:
[LIST]
[*][B]⚡ 100% Lag-Free Performance:[/B] Everything runs asynchronously in the background. Your server stays at a steady 20 TPS even under heavy player counts.
[*][B]🏆 Automated Seasons & Resets:[/B] Automate your weekly, monthly, or custom seasons. The plugin resets rankings, archives past winners, and delivers rewards without you lifting a finger.
[*][B]🎁 Guaranteed Automatic Rewards:[/B] 1st, 2nd, and 3rd place winners get their rewards (money, items, keys) automatically on login or via [ICODE]/season claim[/ICODE].
[*][B]🌐 Easy Multi-Server Sync:[/B] Connect your Survival, BoxPvP, and Lobbies seamlessly with MySQL, MariaDB, or SQLite.
[*][B]🎨 Beautiful Anti-Dupe Menus:[/B] Fully customizable GUIs and floating spawn holograms with built-in click debouncing that completely blocks item duplication and menu glitches.
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#00c6ff][B]✦ Feature Highlights[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[B]1. Declarative YAML Engine ([ICODE]stats.yml[/ICODE]):[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Create custom statistics for mining, PvP, mob kills, fishing, and item consumption.
[*]Filter by materials, entity types, game modes, worlds, and [B]WorldGuard regions[/B] ([ICODE]regions: [arena_pvp, vip_mine][/ICODE]).
[*]Add permission multipliers (e.g. VIP players earn x2 stats).
[*]Configure progressive milestones and Battle Pass tiers with automatic broadcasts and console reward commands.
[*]Define seasonal podium rewards (Top 1, Top 2, Top 3) directly inside each stat definition under [ICODE]season-rewards:[/ICODE].
[/LIST]

[B]2. Interactive Anti-Dupe Menus ([ICODE]/top[/ICODE] & [ICODE]/halloffame[/ICODE]):[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Custom slot mapping: configure Top 10 podium positions in any slot coordinate you want ([ICODE]1: 13, 2: 21, 3: 23...[/ICODE]).
[*]Strict click cancellation on HIGHEST priority prevents item duplication, shift-click glitches, and hotbar number key swapping.
[*]Integrated 150ms anti-macro debounce filter prevents autoclicker abuse.
[/LIST]

[B]3. DecentHolograms & PlaceholderAPI Integration:[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Spawn dynamic floating leaderboards at your spawn with a single command: [ICODE]/bhe holo create <stat> [size][/ICODE].
[*]15+ sub-microsecond in-memory PlaceholderAPI placeholders for Holograms, TAB, Scoreboards, and Chat formats.
[/LIST]

[B]4. Built-in Internationalization (EN / ES):[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Full English and Spanish message templates included out of the box. Switch instantly in [ICODE]config.yml[/ICODE] via [ICODE]locale: "en"[/ICODE] or [ICODE]locale: "es"[/ICODE].
[/LIST]

