[SIZE=5][COLOR=#00c6ff][B]✦ PlaceholderAPI Reference[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][ICODE]%bluehell_stat_<stat_id>%[/ICODE] - Raw numerical stat value.
[*][ICODE]%bluehell_stat_formatted_<stat_id>%[/ICODE] - Formatted value with thousands separators (e.g. 1,450).
[*][ICODE]%bluehell_rank_<stat_id>%[/ICODE] - Player's rank position (#1, #2, #3, or N/A).
[*][ICODE]%bluehell_top_<stat_id>_<pos>_name%[/ICODE] - Name of player at leaderboard position.
[*][ICODE]%bluehell_top_<stat_id>_<pos>_value%[/ICODE] - Score of player at leaderboard position.
[*][ICODE]%bluehell_season_current_name%[/ICODE] - Name of the active season (e.g. Genesis).
[*][ICODE]%bluehell_season_time_remaining%[/ICODE] - Formatted countdown until season ends (e.g. 14d 5h).
[*][ICODE]%bluehell_history_<season>_<stat>_<rank>_name%[/ICODE] - Past season podium winner name.
[*][ICODE]%bluehell_history_<season>_<stat>_<rank>_score%[/ICODE] - Past season podium winner score.
[*][ICODE]%bluehell_has_<stat_id>_<min>%[/ICODE] - Returns [I]true[/I] or [I]false[/I] if player has >= minimum score.
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#00c6ff][B]✦ Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

[B]Q: Does this plugin require a MySQL database?[/B]
A: No! By default, BlueHellStats uses local SQLite file storage ([ICODE]bluehell.db[/ICODE]). You don't need to install or configure any database server. If you run a network, you can switch to MySQL, MariaDB, or PostgreSQL in seconds.

[B]Q: What happens if a podium winner is offline when the season ends?[/B]
A: Rewards are safely stored in the durable [ICODE]season_rewards_queue[/ICODE] database table. As soon as the player logs in to ANY connected server, their rewards are automatically executed via console and marked as claimed.

[B]Q: Can I customize the GUI layout and slots?[/B]
A: Absolutely! All menus in [ICODE]plugins/BlueHellEssence/menus/[/ICODE] support free slot coordinates, custom skull textures, MiniMessage color tags, and customizable action buttons.

